			&lt;p&gt;This magic ammunition is meant to slay Aberrations. If an Aberration takes damage from the ammunition, it makes a DC 17 Constitution saving throw, taking an extra 6d10 Force damage on a failed save or half as much extra damage on a successful one.&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;p class="indent"&gt;After dealing its extra damage to an Aberration, the ammunition becomes nonmagical.&lt;/p&gt;
