		&amp;lt;description&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;You gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with this magic weapon.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p class="indent"&amp;gt;Any Humanoid you hit with the weapon takes an extra 2d6 Slashing damage, and you gain Temporary Hit Points equal to the extra damage dealt.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
