	&lt;element name="Ammunition, +2" type="Magic Item" source="Dungeon Master’s Guide (2024)" id="ID_WOTC_DMG24_MAGIC_ITEM_AMMUNITION_2"&gt;
		&lt;description&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;You have a +2 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this piece of magic ammunition. Once it hits a target, the ammunition is no longer magical.&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;p class="indent"&gt;This ammunition is typically found or sold in quantities of ten or twenty pieces. Ten pieces of this, ammunition are equivalent in value to a potion of the same rarity.&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;/description&gt;
		&lt;sheet alt="+2 Ammunition" /&gt;
