	&amp;lt;element name="Adamantine Weapon" type="Magic Item" source="Dungeon Master’s Guide (2024)" id="ID_WOTC_DMG24_MAGIC_ITEM_ADAMANTINE_WEAPON"&amp;gt;
		&amp;lt;description&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;This weapon is made of adamantine, one of the hardest substances in existence. Whenever this weapon or piece of ammunition hits an object, the hit is a Critical Hit.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
		&amp;lt;/description&amp;gt;
		&amp;lt;setters&amp;gt;
