			&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;Bound into this weapon is a level 6 spell. The spell is determined when the weapon is created and must belong to the Conjuration, Divination, Evocation, Necromancy, or Transmutation school of magic. The weapon has 6 charges and regains 1d6 expended charges daily at dawn. While wielding the weapon, you can expend 1 charge to cast its spell.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
