	&amp;lt;element name="Weapon of Warning" type="Magic Item" source="Dungeon Master’s Guide (2024)" id="ID_WOTC_DMG24_MAGIC_ITEM_WEAPON_OF_WARNING"&amp;gt;
		&amp;lt;description&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;As long as this weapon is within your reach and you are attuned to it, you and allies within 30 feet of you gain the following benefits.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p class="indent"&amp;gt;&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;i&amp;gt;Alarm.&amp;lt;/i&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt; The weapon magically awakens each subject who is sleeping naturally when combat begins. This benefit doesn't wake a subject from magically induced sleep.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p class="indent"&amp;gt;&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;i&amp;gt;Supernatural Readiness.&amp;lt;/i&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt; Each subject has Advantage on its Initiative rolls.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
		&amp;lt;/description&amp;gt;
		&amp;lt;setters&amp;gt;
